WSP Agent reimplements the agent harness of "Sparks of Weight-Space Programming" (Takehi et al., MIT CSAIL, 2026;
https://rikiyat.github.io/blog/weight-space-programming). That harness was not released; this one was rebuilt from the
authors' published logs (https://github.com/RikiyaT/lm_understand-logs). This project is independent of the paper's
authors and is not endorsed by them. The code in this repository is under the MIT License (LICENSE), except as below.


