   https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/legalcode

   Source: "Logs, data and networks" of https://github.com/RikiyaT/lm_understand-logs, by the authors of the paper.
   Provided as is, without warranties.

   Where it is used here:
   - wsp/messages.py: harness messages, verbatim or lightly edited (each is marked [paper] or [ours]).
   - wsp/tasks/qwen_math/task.py and wsp/tasks/edge/task.py: task prompts, adapted to this hardware and to a new task.
   - research/*.md: analyses of the logs, with quotations from them.
   - The Codex settings in wsp/llm.py: adapted from harness/codex_config.toml.
   Changes: the text was edited for the hardware, tasks and harness of this project.


